        "Photorealistic studio character reference. Exactly one person, plain neutral light gray background, soft even light, realistic skin and fabric. No text, no panels, no props unless part of the outfit. Entire body including head and both shoes, centered, 6 percent margin above and below, relaxed upright neutral stance, arms slightly away from torso, hands empty. Eye-level camera, natural long-lens perspective, no foreshortening. Picture 1 is the sole facial identity reference: preserve facial proportions, eyes, nose, mouth, age appearance and skin tone. Picture 2 supplies clothing, footwear, accessories and hairstyle only when explicitly part of its headwear; ignore the identity of its wearer. Dress the person from Picture 1 in the complete outfit from Picture 2. Straight front view facing the camera. Keep garment colors, cut, fastenings and details. If footwear is unseen use simple matching shoes. If multiple people are in Picture 2 use the central person only. Preserve natural facial detail."
